  "modified": "2026-10-08T09:11:08Z",
  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: use-after-free in mod_rewrite lookahead variables\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-56154.patch: copy the Vary value gathered\n       during a LA-U/LA-F lookahead into the main request pool before the\n       sub-request is destroyed in modules/mappers/mod_rewrite.c.\n     - CVE-2026-56154\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: buffer overflow in mod_vhost_alias interpolation\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-63292.patch: reject a VirtualDocumentRoot\n       expansion segment that does not fit the buffer in\n       modules/mappers/mod_vhost_alias.c.\n     - CVE-2026-63292\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: crash in mod_xml2enc on incomplete input\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-63686.patch: handle APR_INCOMPLETE from the\n       converter and pass the rest raw after a conversion failure instead\n       of reusing a NULL converter in modules/filters/mod_xml2enc.c.\n     - CVE-2026-63686\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: digest replay and use-after-free in mod_auth_digest\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-73636_CVE-2026-73637.patch: enforce one-time\n       nonce and nonce-count handling, and only use shared client entries\n       under the client lock, in modules/aaa/mod_auth_digest.c.\n     - CVE-2026-73636\n     - CVE-2026-73637",
